        "### Multi-Qubit Circuits in PennyLane\n",
        "\n",
        "To build a multi-qubit circuit:\n",
        "1. **Define a Device:** Initialize `qml.device` with the parameter `wires=N` (where $N$ is the number of qubits).\n",
        "2. **Apply Multi-Qubit Gates:** Use gates like `qml.CNOT(wires=[control, target])` or `qml.CZ(wires=[control, target])`.\n",
        "3. **Perform Measurements:** You can return expectation values (`qml.expval`), probabilities (`qml.probs`), or state vectors (`qml.state`)."
      ]
    },
